# Gym Identity T1 (Flintridge): quarry-cut stone floor — warm Boulder browns laid as cut blocks in running bond, seams in deep quarry shade. Flintridge's own floor — split from its skeleton twin Fernmere (loamfloor) entire: cut stone with drawn seams vs packed seamless loam, warm tan vs deep umber.
